Hello everyone,

We updated the Matchstick - Coffee Break Club with a few new options:

- Window mode was added;
- Intro logo can be skipped (esc or spacebar);
- Sound of into logo will match the sounds you set up into the game;

Thanks for the support and feedback we are receiving from the community

And please, let us know if you find any other issues and we will try to fix it as soon as possible ːsteamhappyː

